 mi Ito\, Director of the Connected Learning Lab\, Professor Sherry Turkle\
 , founding director of the MIT Initiative on Technology and Self\, and Mik
 e Rizkalla\, CEO & Founder of Snorble\, a visionary leader in AI\, consume
 r robotics\, humanoid robotics\, and children's technology.\nhttps://calen
